            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "In addition, areal losses since 1920 and 1850 are evaluated for 100 m intervals. The areal losses since 1920 have been evaluated for 47 per cent of all glaciers and those since 1850 for 68 per cent.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": false,
